  clock: 5  # a9ca
  nonce: a9ca  # a9ca
  message: "STATEMENT REWRITTEN 2026-09-23 (INV-zikab step 7) to follow ADR-0059, as the ratified order required. The old statement defined IoPrimitive.kind as 'the construct of the DEFINITION' (R1), which the panel rejected. The item stays VIOLATED: route 1 of method_starved_modules still joins call_construct to kind by bare membership, a proxy whose looseness is now stated in its docstring (one method-stamped edge satisfies a whole module; Process.exitValue shields scala.sys.process.Process). The second join site (the INV-nizom arm) was narrowed in PR #1159."  # a9ca
